    (property "Note" "Bank B, cylinder 2 alone. Drawn as its own shunt rather than merged with bank A's, so the two ADC channels the pin map allocates (PTC15 / PTD19, one per ADC instance for simultaneous sampling) stay independent." (id 5) (at 500.0 260.0 0)
